The flight statuses come from the Flight Status API of Air France-KLM (Open
Data, https://developer.airfranceklm.com), read with the key of each user's
own application, under the terms of use of the developer portal. The widgets
say that the data comes from Air France-KLM. The file
test/fixtures/flightstatus.json is a reduced extract of an answer of this API
for 18 May 2025, used by the tests only.

